<section data-comp="columns" class="ss-component ss-columns  break-out     " id="item638618" data-pageid="stack_columns" data-parentid="467362_2" data-elemid="638618">
            
    <div id="stack_content_638618" class="">
            <div class="ss-component-header container">
        <h2 class="ss-component-header-title">Board</h2>
    </div>        <div class="ss-component-content container background-break-out ss-one-column">
            <div class="ss-columns-details-wrapper">
                <div class="ss-editor-content ss-component-intro "></div>
            </div>
            <div class="ss-component-column-wrapper ss-one-column" data-testid="columns-column-wrapper">
                <div class="ss-editor-content ss-component-column ss-column-one ">
                                        <p>The School Board is composed of seven members, mirroring the local legislative body (Board of Mayor &amp; Aldermen). Members are elected to four-year terms (every other year) by the citizens of Millington. Elections are held in November, with installation of new Board members in December.&nbsp;The Board is a corporate, policy-making, body that sets the vision for the school district&nbsp;and adopts policies to implement and support that vision. The Board is then responsible for promoting the schools and the school district.</p>
                </div>
                                                            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
