            </div>
            <div class="ss-component-column-wrapper ss-one-column" data-testid="columns-column-wrapper">
                <div class="ss-editor-content ss-component-column ss-column-one ">
                                        <p><em><u>Regular business meetings</u> are held the</em><em>&nbsp;first Monday of every month at Millington Central High Performing Arts Center (PAC).&nbsp;<u>Work Sessions</u>&nbsp;(if needed) will be&nbsp;held the third Thursday of each month.&nbsp;<u>Special called meetings</u>&nbsp;are held on an as needed basis and will be announced.</em></p>
                </div>
